  "description": "From CX Nationals to Dirt Crits to Getting to Work On Time. The Tactical Advantage For Race Day and Beyond.\nThis is the new generation of performance driven drop bar dirt bike. The OMEN features nimble geometry, massive mud clearance, a custom drawn 3/2.5 titanium tube set, disc brakes, and offers the stability and control of tapered steerer forks to rail everything from off-camber cyclocross mudfests to rutted country roads to sketchy city streets.\nFor the holy season of the fall and winter CX race schedule, the OMEN shines bright as a diamond. Beyond the checkered flag the bike continues to deliver, always primed to roll mileage, be it as an off season road training bike, an exotic commuter, or a vehicle for backcountry adventures. Rack and fender mounts ensure a clean and solid fit with practical accessories; the ability to run 700x42c tires and best-in-class ground clearance deliver the goods on the trail; and small details like a replaceable full titanium derailleur hanger and the rock solid REN warranty mean your new best friend will be as reliable as it is fun.\nOn the race course, on the trail, or on the streets, the OMEN is ready. Are you?\nRouting for 2x shift and external rear brake\n44mm Head Tube compatible with tapered or straight steerer forks\nCompatible with Shimano Di2/FSA WE internal electronic shift system wiring\nREN headbadge + Classic Black decals\nAlloy seatpost collar",
